-- The sections marked HAND-WRITTEN at the end are the parts Prisma cannot
-- express; they live in this migration (rather than a second tool) so
-- `prisma migrate deploy` applies everything in one place.
--
-- Changes to existing tables are limited to two nullable columns on
-- "VisitNote". Booking, availability and locking tables are untouched.

